# ============================================================================
# Kristle is being rebuilt deliberately, one roadmap feature at a time, via
# Spec Kit (see ROADMAP.md — itself local-only and never committed). Until
# that rebuild is complete, this repo tracks ONLY the Spec Kit scaffolding;
# everything else (app source, platform folders, build files, IDE config,
# lockfiles, docs) stays untracked — present on disk, absent from git — so
# `git status` and diffs only ever show intentional, spec-kit-driven changes.
# See ROADMAP.md's Implementation rules for exactly when to remove this
# ignore-everything block and start tracking the app for real.
# ============================================================================
/*

!/.claude/
!/.specify/
!/specs/
!/.gitignore

# Local planning notes — never committed even after the rebuild finishes.
/ROADMAP.md
